      "content": "i feel like i'm constantly fighting to be heard. when i'm in meetings or just talking to people, i can feel this immense authority inside me, but they just see me as another person. i know i have to start preparing to lead the next phase, the move to the colony and everything... how do i start acting like someone with that kind of lineage so people actually respect the truth?",
